[{"title":"春闺病起和黄得之先生作","author":"张献翼","text":"佳气抱房栊，年华自不穷。\n山将眉合翠，花傍镜分红。\n晓色罗衣上，春声燕垒中。\n犹怜芳树下，无力倚东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5700,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"投赠兼视苏君楫沈元异","author":"张献翼","text":"白门烟月胜扬州，十四楼中第一流。\n眉学远山余黛色，心将初柳结春愁。\n渡头桃叶王孙草，巷口乌衣客子裘。\n都市相逢多意气，与君同作五陵游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5701,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集孙指挥宅","author":"张献翼","text":"入林欣把臂，萧散欲飞翻。\n酒亦将军令，花仍处士村。\n清香浮画戟，残月上营门。\n无敌夸诗思，长城在五言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5702,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思和黄吉甫","author":"张献翼","text":"鸳鸯七十自成双，翠袖红颜映碧泷。\n淮水有时邀玉笛，秦楼无伴对银缸。\n梨云入夜长飞梦，桃叶乘春欲渡江。\n相望本无千里隔，共看明月照寒窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5703,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕同赵令燕赋","author":"张献翼","text":"翠帐红妆送客亭，佳人眉黛远山青。\n试从天上看河汉，今夜应无织女星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5704,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪游二首 其一","author":"张献翼","text":"银河耿耿夜迢迢，月满关山旅雁高。\n明日孤帆去何处，秣陵秋色广陵涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5705,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪游二首 其二","author":"张献翼","text":"萍聚长干兴未穷，劳劳亭外起寒风。\n只今海内称兄弟，半在当筵气概中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5706,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杜鹃花漫兴","author":"张献翼","text":"花花叶叶正含芳，丽景朝朝夜夜长。\n何事江南春去尽，子规声里驻年光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5707,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"张献翼","text":"燕子来时花又残，一宵明月两情看。\n春风吹遍王孙草，门外天涯去住难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5708,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘会卿病中典衣买歌者因持絮酒就其丧所试之","author":"张献翼","text":"昨日经过欢燕时，满堂歌舞金屈卮。\n日日日斜舞长袖，夜夜夜深歌接䍦。\n今日欢情犹未足，炙鸡絮酒还来续。\n何戡虽善歌，唐衢亦善哭。\n一生一死复一杯，或歌或泣还成曲。\n座上多白云，门前总流水。\n人琴叹俱亡，风流浑不死。\n十千五千未满杯，三弦四弦已盈耳。\n佳婿佳儿垞帐前，故人故宴帷堂里。\n山阳笛，伯牙琴，至今千载为知音。\n平生尊酒若常在，生死交情深不深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5709,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再过刘会卿丧所卜胡姬为尸仍设双俑为侍命伶人奏琵琶而乐之","author":"张献翼","text":"昨日经过旧堂宿，今日经过旧堂哭。\n交情今日尽凋残，草堂自此成幽独。\n追忆平生颜，宛然在心目。\n炙鸡絮酒去复来，素车白马情未足。\n君不见古人祭天亦有尸，迎尸今日迎胡姬。\n胡姬旧为门下客，曾问今宵是何夕。\n今日寓其神，栖其魄，笑语若平生，欢宴未终毕。\n坐上坐，身外身，此时此际相主宾。\n存殁几时分两地，宾主何曾是两人。\n谁谓君不起，音容忽凭几。\n胡姬代君饮，胡姬代君语。\n谁云君不知，对酒君不辞。\n谁言君不见，肝肠在颜面。\n两两为刍灵，侍立何亭亭。\n不知向秀《思旧赋》，不为庾信《思旧铭》。\n中郎虎贲意有托，不知为蝴蝶兮为螟蛉。\n一杯酹先酒，二杯献吾友，三杯且共斟，停云在郊薮。\n《前缓声》连《后缓声》，《大垂手》兼《小垂手》。\n一弹遽沉吟，再弹怆已深，三弄犹自可，四奏伤知音。\n君再生，我未死，相看半死生，何处分悲喜。\n一声《薤露》杂《吴歈》，一唱《阳关》入《蒿里》。\n思其人，到其堂，依然其处在，谁谓其人亡？\n予尝忤流俗，君偏嗜昌歜。\n今日胡姬为主人，朝云朝露迫我身。\n不及黄泉也相见，长踏陆土如沉沦。\n为君歌，为君舞，酒到刘伶坟上土。\n呜呼！\n酒到刘伶坟上土。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5710,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕同陆姬过胡姬并怀侯双","author":"张献翼","text":"君不见张敉名字在月中，又不见乞歌携妓张红红。\n灯火未然月未出，名字不闻五百弓。\n白月已来黑月去，三五能供几番醉。\n心计对饮同三驺，何如买笑携诸妓。\n街头巷口自为歌，博塞藏阄总成戏。\n昔年残腊逢春阳，然灯每夜客满堂。\n今夜朋来贫未足，酒过墙头食无肉。\n南方腾笑北献嘲，贱于犬马轻于毛。\n数点虽非九枝艳，也知今夕为元宵。\n夜未央，从吾好。\n身衣鹑，手执翿。\n酒因境多，年随情少。\n或云布衣雄世郑康成，或云叩门乞食陶渊明。\n绿烟朱火青楼起，一杯一杯情未已。\n放意且留欢，遗老堪忘死。\n陆姬立之监，胡姬佐之史。\n胡一抗吾吭，陆二提吾耳。\n忆昔侯姬尝去来，来时往往相尔汝。\n谓我非常人，爱我无常语。\n攀玩今宵少一人，安得侯双唤张敉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5711,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下戏示儿侄","author":"张献翼","text":"夜色上星辰，秋来兴有神。\n好书仍诫子，盗酒亦娱亲。\n月作谁家客，风为我辈人。\n承欢在庭下，倍觉露华新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5712,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张廉水乞予生祭奇其意而成咏","author":"张献翼","text":"祭是生前设，魂非死后招。\n池台总长夜，薤露岂崇朝。\n入梦惊离合，迎神讶动摇。\n嗒然如隔世，云臼坐相邀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5713,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桐江夜泊","author":"吴扩","text":"系舟人语静，纤月映江波。\n木叶秋交下，山烟晚更多。\n隔云孤磬杳，照水一萤过。\n渔子间相狎，中宵发浩歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5714,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同白平溪宿古竺","author":"吴扩","text":"天竺古名林，幽期晚共寻。\n涧阴藏宿雨，松籁答鸣琴。\n曲笕分泉细，荒除落叶深。\n中宵无一语，愈觉契禅心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5715,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀伯兄","author":"吴扩","text":"老至无家别，飘零何处边。\n音书常不定，生死竟谁传。\n朔雁伤秋思，阴虫搅夜眠。\n空庭孤月下，顾影一潸然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5716,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同华许诸君横塘舟中漫兴","author":"吴扩","text":"四月溪深花气微，远烟明灭闪晴晖。\n柳条蘸水碧于染，麦穗连云黄不稀。\n双燕掠波分画桨，片霞生雨洒春衣。\n同舟况是高阳侣，汗漫三江未拟归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5717,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠水帘周道人","author":"吴扩","text":"洞锁千峰紫气蒸，峭厓珠瀑乱漰腾。\n道人结屋云深处，自捣茶油供佛灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5718,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"募兵行六首 其一","author":"谢少南","text":"玺书五道发甘泉，技俩兼收作控弦。\n募府未摅平虏策，县官先办犒兵钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5719,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"募兵行六首 其二","author":"谢少南","text":"猿臂虬须不解文，生来提剑浊河濆。\n仇家莫记从前事，今日朝廷靖虏军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5720,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"募兵行六首 其三","author":"谢少南","text":"金勒雕鞍騕袅才，何须论价买龙媒。\n总拚乐土千人产，蹴踏沙场万里开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5721,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"募兵行六首 其四","author":"谢少南","text":"飞鞚尘中问酒家，帽檐犹戴射场花。\n弦筝今夕垆头醉，明日横戈度碛沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5722,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"募兵行六首 其五","author":"谢少南","text":"殊才奇技互争夸，尽道玄枢自一家。\n神定座中占遁甲，机成空里扬飙车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5723,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"募兵行六首 其六","author":"谢少南","text":"酾酒椎牛出度支，绣袍错甲好男儿。\n书生握算休辞费，尽扫穹庐君始知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5724,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"府江杂诗六首 其一","author":"谢少南","text":"蛮烟不雨似云浓，白日阴阴惨澹中。\n炎气薰人冬亦暖，不知何地候春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5725,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"府江杂诗六首 其二","author":"谢少南","text":"石滩激浪殷成雷，轻舸飘飘曲折开。\n水楼鞑舍横矛立，山洞猺人负弩回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5726,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"府江杂诗六首 其三","author":"谢少南","text":"冬炎卉木未萧条，暂倚蓬窗旅况销。\n树架绿垂君子蔓，崖林红破美人蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5727,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"府江杂诗六首 其四","author":"谢少南","text":"水落荒洲近客船，弯环苦竹剧钩连。\n风霜不到崖前木，鼠穴多歧有岁年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5728,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"府江杂诗六首 其五","author":"谢少南","text":"隘口分弓号摆滩，领班人戴白鹇冠。\n莫言南徼无冰雪，映日戈明水帐寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5729,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"府江杂诗六首 其六","author":"谢少南","text":"落日官军举号齐，雕戈画盾障山蹊。\n不嫌铜斗通宵击，却厌斑鸡半岭啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5730,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日登雨花台","author":"陈凤","text":"落叶山中寺，秋风江上台。\n凤城双阙迥，牛渚片帆来。\n繁吹暮仍急，清樽醉复开。\n东篱菊尚晚，留取尽余杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5731,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中酬诸君见过","author":"陈凤","text":"久雨空堂静，高人载酒过。\n布袍同濩落，长铗任悲歌。\n水气浮高柳，秋容入败荷。\n明朝是九日，无菊欲如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5732,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戴文进溪山春雨图","author":"陈凤","text":"林间雀声急，知有少女风。\n溪云挟雨至，倏忽弥春空。\n霏霏湿尽山桥路，行人冲雨行唤渡。\n沾泥涉险亦何为，兴来疑向若耶去。\n山环水绕路不分，绝径乃有逃名人。\n贪看秀色卷帘坐，不觉岚气侵衣巾。\n林花落地半随水，流向前溪犹未已。\n新水才添势正雄，客舟多系垂杨里。\n意匠经营何太奇，空堂素壁迥含姿。\n恍然对此翻自讶，如在山村看雨时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5733,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藕花居","author":"陈凤","text":"十里莲花过眼新，水风犹自起香尘。\n明年还约看花侣，来唤湖边雪藕人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5734,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星","author":"许谷","text":"丽天疑有质，连贝各呈辉。\n森布标分野，群来捧太微。\n宵占贤士聚，晓觉故人稀。\n独喜旄头落，天山奏凯归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5735,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过德州","author":"许谷","text":"楼船御北风，渺渺过齐东。\n种秫生涯薄，诛茅结构同。\n日沉平野上，人语近村中。\n水面看牛斗，星槎似可通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5736,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汤世登","author":"许谷","text":"万里携家上海船，到时黎蛋拜车前。\n鲸涛蜃雾围官舍，铁树琼花照酒筵。\n验岁土人占草节，采珠波客候龙眠。\n遥知问俗经过地，停旆常投饮马钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5737,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集沈大理次韵","author":"许谷","text":"青鬓仙人列九卿，锦觞邀客对春城。\n筵前香篆将花气，院外松风杂鸟声。\n山带钟陵苍霭合，池分玄武绿波平。\n追欢近夜飘疏雨，归路垂鞭信马行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5738,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠何翰林致仕居金陵次文太史韵","author":"许谷","text":"金马来时动镐京，银鱼焚后别西清。\n才人岂厌承明地，高士原多谷口情。\n买得曲池堪斗鸭，种成芳树好藏莺。\n秦淮亦是机云宅，乡梦休过白苎城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5739,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏偶成次薛考功韵","author":"许谷","text":"少日弹冠非贡禹，老来学圃似樊迟。\n平生爱我无如酒，凡事输人不但棋。\n一亩旧临佳丽地，四言新和《考槃》诗。\n炎风朔雪年年转，裘褐无心总不知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5740,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂兴次罗赞善韵四首 其一","author":"许谷","text":"住世谁看石化牛，寄生真梦蝶为周。\n因游淮水留孤艇，为看钟山结小楼。\n旧牍堆床鱼乱走，新篘入盏蚁先浮。\n杜陵自识吟诗趣，苦思何缘老未休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5741,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂兴次罗赞善韵四首 其二","author":"许谷","text":"谷口无劳慕子真，白门我亦种瓜人。\n贫因好客常赊酒，老为祈年每赛神。\n独喜葵阴能卫足，翻嗟象齿竟焚身。\n秋禾夏麦谋生好，岁岁欣尝两度新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5742,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂兴次罗赞善韵四首 其三","author":"许谷","text":"为谢山灵莫献嘲，年来泉石许论交。\n开轩不剪蘼芜草，上树能窥鸟鹊巢。\n竹坞有风门不闭，茶铛无火石频敲。\n闲中亦有关心处，药裹书签两未抛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5743,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂兴次罗赞善韵四首 其四","author":"许谷","text":"静里浑将岁月忘，澄神端坐竹方床。\n济时已负廷三策，算老俄惊杖一乡。\n寸管窥天形太狭，北辕之越路空长。\n玄谈绮语知无补，不及潜心《道德》章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5744,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠内","author":"许谷","text":"结缡独记少年时，转眼今看白发齐。\n老去真成鹿门侣，醉来曾笑太常妻。\n棋裁纸局闲频画，艇泛鱼波晚共携。\n却怪灯前询割肉，不知名姓隔金闺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5745,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊毗陵有怀张文洲","author":"许堂","text":"迢递毗陵道，临流石阁重。\n西风疏雁阵，斜日变山容。\n树隐前村火，风传远寺钟。\n遥思张子野，杯酒正从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5746,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张舜卿园亭","author":"许堂","text":"绿阴深巷寂无哗，小结茅亭玩物华。\n花散余香来客座，竹分新翠过邻家。\n锦袍垂手闲调鹤，乌帽笼头自煮茶。\n况值承平常偃武，不妨诗酒作生涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5747,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梅","author":"许堂","text":"烂熳南枝与北枝，残香落落影离离。\n多情明月还相照，无赖狂风且莫吹。\n纵饮不辞今日醉，算开犹是隔年期。\n最怜今夜黄昏后，寂寞微吟倚树时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5748,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刻竹诗","author":"文衡山","text":"萧萧落木带江干，剪剪幽花过雨斑。\n岂意旅游逢九日，共来把酒看三山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5749,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对酒","author":"黄甲","text":"齐瑟未工，楚玉奚辨。\n千仞蒙?，一枝规晏。\n箕毕各肠，鹬蚌交患。\n枕边蝴蝶，隙中鹏鴳。\n南阳结庐，西蜀焚栈。\n感兹醍醐，殉我皤弁。\n此乾此坤，此丘此涧。\n何虑何营，何真何赝。\n化凿为天，击唾成幻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5750,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长门怨","author":"黄甲","text":"翠华恩歇玉生尘，十二琼楼空复春。\n却为看花解憔悴，只应秋叶是前身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唤客","author":"黄甲","text":"来日桃花坞，烦君幸一过。\n人嫌开宴晚，花喜入茵多。\n雨过应沾坐，闲来好漫过。\n春风浑不惜，吹尽欲如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与董生对牡丹酌","author":"黄甲","text":"春色醲如许，名花故自繁。\n春来翻更懒，花发与谁言。\n汝过苔应破，庭空竹尚存。\n一壶聊复醉，从此坐窥园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日山斋","author":"黄甲","text":"雨添春水漫，溪上鳜鱼肥。\n月出僧因过，船归鹊正飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5754,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出郭","author":"黄甲","text":"出郭理蚕田，幽居此最先。\n莺啼江树杪，月抱野亭偏。\n社肉分邻叟，园丁了税钱。\n儿欢裒腊蚁，客过并溪船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5755,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐二首 其一","author":"黄甲","text":"落月满江城，乾坤此夜情。\n檐楹河汉色，苍藓辘轳声。\n梦断嗟难续，年催思转萦。\n想因魔尽退，醒眼毕吾生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5756,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐二首 其二","author":"黄甲","text":"雨歇夜初霁，鹊飞星正疏。\n乾坤灯下影，魂魄枕边书。\n隔水分更漏，前身想木鱼。\n岑岑天欲曙，头白不堪梳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5757,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十六夜祖董生北行","author":"黄甲","text":"江南今夕月，清光犹似昨。\n君行背雁飞，明日堪谁酌。\n孤情月正中，照汝颜如削。\n愿君霜树年，遗风远摧薄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5758,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静海寺与观颐夜坐","author":"黄甲","text":"落木乱山巅，江楼雪夜船。\n山川千里外，风雨一灯前。\n白发翻歧路，清尊共昔年。\n浮生窥妄尽，今夕故依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5759,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌五首 其一 春","author":"胡汝嘉","text":"黄鸟鸣深林，往来疾于织。\n非无机杼声，其奈不成匹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5760,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌五首 其二 夏","author":"胡汝嘉","text":"湘筠织成箔，瞥眼便相亲。\n漫将心附郎，别有帘外人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5761,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌五首 其三 秋","author":"胡汝嘉","text":"矰蛸网朱户，露叶藏暗萤。\n与君几日别，忽地秋风生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5762,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌五首 其四 冬","author":"胡汝嘉","text":"起来不梳头，冒冷弄冰雪。\n侬手原不寒，郎心为谁热。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5763,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌五首 其五","author":"胡汝嘉","text":"月照庭上雪，灿若玉玲珑。\n风吹雪如絮，飞入锦屏中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白皦春辞","author":"胡汝嘉","text":"小窗西畔月轮斜，铜博山前散紫霞。\n宴罢不知春夜促，醉凭红袖看梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]